+    This module implements the hard disk boot driver for the DECstation
+    5000/200.  The disk is the device the REX console booted the firmware
+    from, which the driver reads and writes in 512 byte blocks with the
+    console boot services.  It is named scsi(0)disk(N)rdisk(0), N being the
+    SCSI identifier of the disk in the console boot path (slot/rzN/file).
